        "id": 1809582
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-07-06T23:45:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could the two cases be simplified as `chan-\u003epending_msg_cnt \u003e\u003d MAX(1, chan-\u003emax_msg_cnt - 1)`? I don\u0027t remember if `max_msg_cnt` can ever be zero.",
